WEBVTT

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.190
A Christmas party on this snowy day sure is nice, huh?

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:34.990
But Christmas on the 22nd would be weird.

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:39.750
It can't be helped. We're out of school on the 23rd and 24th---

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:48.500
Mudo! Mudo! Mudo!

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:54.990
Christmas Eve Miracle

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.680
Are you cold?

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.290
Is it warm?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.220
I see.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.030
Guess it can't be helped you figured it out.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.250
Here, have a bite.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.680
Is it good?

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.400
See? Of course it is.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.710
Here, you too.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.320
Okay, thank you very much.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.820
You guys are in luck!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:52.310
This cake bar is a new product that just went on sale yesterday.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.620
Good morning, Moriyama-kun. Who is this?

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:02.160
Today's Christmas party is going to be fun, huh?

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:02.760
Yeah.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.150
Kyo-chan said she's going to make some snacks.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:05.830
I see.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:09.080
But you know, even if it wasn't Christmas...

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:15.010
You're my Santa Claus that always cheers me up!

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.310
...or something like that!

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.140
You can still eat!? Just how much can go in that stomach of yours?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.110
No, that's enough already.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:30.810
In other words, depending on their heart and feelings, humans are able to endure even in the next world.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.100
So cold...

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.630
The principal's speech is too long!

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.550
I want to go back to our warm classroom.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.240
30 minutes later

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.200
It's finally over!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.030
Let's hurry back and warm up.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.320
Later!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.200
Pote-chan!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:54.220
Pote-chan! The gym was so cold!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.020
No fair!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.300
Are you okay? It's because you ate so greedily.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:09.010
That's right, Pote. There's going to be a feast too.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.680
Are they all handmade?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:19.690
There are roll cake, cookies, chocolate biscuits and there's also chicken and salad later.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:21.990
And...

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.500
Mini splatter balls!

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.020
How's that 'mini'?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.480
How about it? Want to try one?

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.300
Alright, then a little mini splatter ball experiment.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.640
Are you okay, Pote-chan?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.080
Hey, Guchuko!

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.790
Are you okay, Pote-chan?

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.660
Those two don't get along very well, huh?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.850
Maybe they're just fighting over food?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.510
Oh, poor you!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.030
Here, I'll give you my candy.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.400
This is a really clear approach.

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:19.100
This one's no good?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.180
And she even rejected it.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.450
Mudo...

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.390
There's a lot of random ones to choose from.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.220
Yeah, just a little.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.930
Give me one too.

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.120
Geez, can't be helped, huh?

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:41.170
Here you go.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.090
How is it? Good, right?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.500
Bully

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.390
Guchuko defeated

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.700
Alright, attention!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.680
Everyone gather around!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:06.050
We're behind on the Christmas preparations we're about to do .

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.390
Listen! Don't needlessly complain and let's get this over with!

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:13.980
Hey! Someone help us put up the decorations!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.020
Hey, who put this charm on?

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.250
It was probably Ei-chan.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.290
Did you call me?

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:24.020
Hey, Yanase. Were there 3 cakes in total?

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.510
Alright then, class rep, a toast to our workers.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.090
Yeah. Does everyone have a cup?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.450
Not me!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:33.710
Hurry up then.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:34.870
Sorry.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.570
Alright, I'm good!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.510
Well then, a toas---

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.920
Huh? Aren't we forgetting something?

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.810
The preparations are done, teacher.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.540
I'm happy you remembered me!

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.420
I have a small presense, huh?

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.310
A toast!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.510
Potemayo.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.090
Are you okay eating so much?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.370
Then that's fine.

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:10.390
Moriyama! Let's have some cake!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.950
Don't eat so much okay?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.520
Pote-chan fell!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.540
Are you okay, Potemayo-chan!?

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.680
She's alive!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.020
Later! See you next year!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.430
Bye!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.210
You're sure tough Poteko!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.890
Is it because her body's soft?

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.870
It's her animal skin.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.180
Oh, that's right!

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:10.510
It's a lie that lions drop their cubs into a bottomless valley!

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:13.990
I saw it on TV but the Savannah has no valleys, right?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.270
We didn't ask that, you stupid dog.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:18.170
Bye, Moriyama-kun.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.700
See you next year!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.480
Winter vacation starts tomorrow.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.510
You're going abroad as usual, right, Nene?

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:28.350
Yep. This year is Italy.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.270
What is it? You're not very energetic.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.630
No, that's not it.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:38.700
Ah, it's that right, Mikan? You can't see Moriyama while it's winter vacation.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:40.870
T-That's not true!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:45.360
You're probably thinking you shouldn't needlessly raise your hopes, right?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.050
That's not true!

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.160
No. It's too late for someone already excited.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.890
That's not true!

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:33.180
Guchuko!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.560
If you're hungry you can come here!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:42.210
What are you doing, Kyo-chan? The party's about to start now.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:43.930
I'm coming now!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.990
Later! Don't catch a cold!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.310
Morning!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.540
Morning! Today's a nice day, huh?

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:04.460
Geez, that girl. I told her she didn't need to thank me.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:16.230
What is it? You're not very energetic.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.160
You can't see Moriyama while it's winter vacation.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.450
That's...! That's...Moriyama-kun!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.770
Moriyama-kun.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.650
Christmas cake?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.010
Yeah, the ones here are good.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:52.960
This is a chance, me! Do your best. Do your best and invite him to our party!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.800
Moriyama-kun! If you'd like, come to our part---

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.600
To think she'd eat the cake I just bought! *

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:42.320
Ah, well, there's only 1 hour left of this year.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.160
The bells of joy are resounding inside. *

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:50.730
While the road to the shrine is lighting up, there are many worshippers heading to pray.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.630
So reporter Yamada-san, how is it over there?

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:55.610
Hello, this is reporter Yamada on the scene.

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:04.370
It's suddenly New Years

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.880
How nice! How nice!

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:24.200
Let's wash away all the dirt, tears and regrets of the past year.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.010
A scholar in foreign customs and Sunao's father, Moriyama Koudai.

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:31.330
I'm the father.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:35.540
What is it, Sunao? Did you grow into a man and surpass me already?

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.460
Show papa the well grown Sunao!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.230
Come on! Come on! Show it to me!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:17.830
Miss, please give this fine boy a jumbo---

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:18.450
Seawood dish.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.570
One seaweed dish.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.690
He saw it after all.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.660
Let's see. What else should we order.

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:34.890
Wagyu beef hamburger and a freshly made sushi boat!?

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.920
That's nice! Nice and luxurious! Then papa will---

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:40.960
That'll be it for us.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:41.760
Okay.

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:45.590
What about papa?

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.720
Well, I'm glad you're doing well.

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.820
These unknown mochi mochi things are growing in numbers too.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.690
Here, Sunao-kun!

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:13.740
Karaoke! Let's karaoke!

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.540
It's been a while so let's do a duet, mom!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:17.530
Alright!

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:21.180
Don't speak so loud you two! It's embarassing!

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.740
Moriyama-kun?

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:25.390
I'm his father.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.540
Dad!?

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.580
Pote...chan?

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:37.670
I see! I see! You're Sunao's classmate.

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:40.210
So how's Sunao? Is he getting along with everyone?

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.070
Yes.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.740
Well, when it comes to him...

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:46.700
*

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:48.910
And so he's that kind of guy.

00:16:51.630 --> 00:16:52.480
Furthermore...

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:21.230
And he's that kind of guy!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.360
I'm going to the toilet.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.200
You're a scholar of foreign culture?

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:29.220
Yeah. Sounds like a lie though, right?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:35.710
I actually wanted to take him along but he just didn't want to leave Japan.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.140
At that time, he was...

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.330
I said your paw.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:43.540
Ah, that's not it. Not this story.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.970
Hey, what's wrong? Are you done, mochi mochi?

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.470
What's wrong? You're slacking off, mochi mochi.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:57.210
I didn't think Moriyama-kun had such a fun dad.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:00.010
I feel relieved for some reason.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.860
Alright then, I don't want to be a bother anymore.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.150
I'll see you again at school.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.520
Big New Year Release!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.700
Sorry.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.510
Are you okay, Mikan-chan?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.330
Hey, Natsu. Get it together. Natsu. Hey. Hey. Natsu.

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:05.500
Ignore This

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:05.300
Hey, sister! Towel! Bring her a towel!

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:13.720
Eating Binge

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.990
Are you okay, Natsu?

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:35.040
Papa's gonna sing too!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.730
Should we order some dessert?

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:06.890
You have a fun dad.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.580
He's just troublesome.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:25.350
Moriyama-kun is usually mature and kind but,

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.590
he's a bit more rough in front of his dad.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.250
He's probably embarassed because he likes him.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.560
How cute.

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:39.300
Hey, Sunao! You sing a song too!

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.900
Hey, are you listening, Suna----

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.390
Later, Moriyama-kun. See you at school.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:55.290
Mika-chan! Take care of Sunao, okay?

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.440
Sunao! It's snow! Snow!

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:13.050
Are you dressed properly? You'll catch a cold!

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.050
By the way, I didn't say it yet, huh?

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.800
Happy New Year, Sunao.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.000
Hey, wear it properly.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:38.520
Let's go to mom's place and greet her.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.970
Have a happy new year.
